From 9ebf019308ea74e14f8c26b53ac46daf6055bcce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 10:32:40 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 001/203] ARM: support Tegra 2 (Cortex-A9, VFPv3-D16) for the
 Toshiba AC100

- build cross tools for vfpv3-d16 instead of vfpv3 (D32)
- save/restore d16-d31 only when the VFP has 32 registers (MVFR0)
- replace the NEON memcpy with the generic C one
- accept the Cortex-A9 GICv1 in the kernel
- add a timer driver for nvidia,tegra20-timer
- recognize nvidia,tegra20-uart; keep the firmware baud divisor when
  the UART input clock is unknown
